# Preprocessing

- Flatten the directory structure to conforme with flow from dataframe workflow.
- Update the metadata.csv with the necessary elements from binary_labels, and the resulting flattening.
- Build and implement the binary_labeller expansion with random background cropping to increase the collection of images with  non-animal labels.
- Oversample the dataset ahead of time, using an aditional data augmentation step:
    . 90º rotation, left and right;
    . x-axis inversion;
    . increase or decrease saturation;
    . increase or decrease brightness;
    . manipulate single channel hue;

